summary:
  Moving a station rewrites every alarm whose address merely contains the old one.

history:
  A podcast alarm names its show as "podcast:" plus the feed address, and
  has its own retarget. A station move that matches by substring would turn
  such an alarm into a plain stream alarm on an address that is no feed.

target:
  package/contents/ui/AlarmEngine.qml

find:
              if ((a.url || "") === oldUrl) {

replace:
              if ((a.url || "").indexOf(oldUrl) !== -1) {

expect:
  Killed by tst_alarmengine::test_a_healed_station_moves_its_alarms.
  Line-neutral.
